- Including the Software in a commercial product;
- Including the Software in paid applications, devices, systems,
  platforms, or services;
- Using the Software to provide a paid service;
- Using the Software in a commercial business operation;
- Monetizing the Software or a substantially derived work;
- Licensing, sublicensing, renting, leasing, or otherwise providing
  the Software for compensation;
- Using the Software in a product or service that generates advertising
  revenue or other direct monetary revenue;
- Using the Software as part of a paid course, paid training product,
